WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:11.167
If you're tired of digging through this confusing official list, wondering whether your file has been announced... we built something for exactly that.

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:13.100
Hi, I'm Elif.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:25.800
The moment your file status changes -- the moment the official site publishes something new -- we notify you instantly, without you lifting a finger. No more checking the site every single day.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:31.067
Same reliability, at a much more affordable price than similar services out there.

00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:38.433
And most importantly -- we don't ask for any personal data. No ID, no contact info, nothing. Just your file number.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:45.733
We're on Android with you right now, and our iOS version is coming soon to the App Store. Stay tuned.
